### Install a REST-client plugin in your editor, or copy these URLs into curl.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Application is alive
GET {{base}}/api/v1/health/live

### Resource readiness
GET {{base}}/api/v1/health/ready

### ID correlation (development/testing only)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/debug/request

### Dependency composition
GET {{base}}/api/v1/debug/dependency

### Domain exception: 404
GET {{base}}/api/v1/debug/not-found

### Query validation: valid
GET {{base}}/api/v1/debug/pagination?limit=25&offset=0

### Query validation: invalid 422
GET {{base}}/api/v1/debug/pagination?limit=250

### Unexpected failure: controlled 500
GET {{base}}/api/v1/debug/boom

### Method not allowed 405
POST {{base}}/api/v1/health/live
